# Project Documentation

This folder contains supporting documentation for the Customer Shopping Trends Analysis project.

## Project Report

The detailed project report explains the business objectives, dataset overview, data preparation, analytical methodology, key findings, and business recommendations developed using SQL, Python, and Power BI.

## Project Components

- **Python:** Data cleaning, exploratory data analysis, and visualisation.
- **SQL:** Data querying and business analysis.
- **Power BI:** Interactive dashboard and visual reporting.
- **Project Report:** Detailed documentation of the analytical workflow and findings.

## Purpose

This documentation helps recruiters and reviewers understand the project objectives, analytical approach, technical skills demonstrated, and business relevance.

For the source code and dashboard, refer to the relevant folders in the main repository.
